    "body": "No, we don't want to extend XMLHttpRequest with new features, except if it gets them through a shared primitive, but that would not be the case here. Also, could you please file an issue against whatwg/fetch with the proposed extension? (See https://annevankesteren.nl/2014/02/monkey-patch for context.)",
